@segment 10-14 Gol'Bolar, Loch Modan I & Fire Totem
@start-level 10
@carry 413
@done 315,287,291      # Shimmer Stout's and the Kharanos chains' earlier steps
# Dwarf Shaman 10-14. Kharanos (Call of Fire) -> east Dun Morogh (Amberstill Ranch, Earthseer Farsen,
# Gol'Bolar Quarry, Ironband's Compound, North Gate Outpost, South Gate Outpost, Bruegs Kindleborn) ->
# South Gate Pass into Loch Modan -> southern tower, Braldir Ashmantle, Stonesplinter Valley ->
# Thelsamar (bind) -> gryphon round trip to Ironforge (Honor Students chain, level 12 training) ->
# north Loch (Stormpike, Silver Stream Mine) -> Thelsamar -> Braldir and the Shrine (Fire quests) ->
# southern tower -> back through the pass to Bruegs = Fire Totem -> hearth to Thelsamar.
# New Forever NPCs placed from the ForeverChanges pins: Ingrid Dunwald, Earthseer Farsen, Rudra's and
# Thesten's new quests, Bruegs Kindleborn, Braldir Ashmantle, the Brazier of the Dormant Flame.
# Deviations from the plan:
#  - 86667 Snowbound is LEFT OUT. It is not a plain delivery: its page says the Jar of Snow must be
#    filled at the South Gate Pass tunnel entrance and then carried to Norric on the north shore, and the
#    quest is only given in Thelsamar. That is south-then-north after Thelsamar, the opposite of this
#    segment's order (the Fire Tar forces north first, then Braldir in the south, then out by the pass),
#    so it would cost an extra Thelsamar <-> pass round trip for 420 XP.
#  - 95212 (leopard pelts) is handed in after the quarry, not before: the map dots put the pelt
#    leopards east of the quarry (70-78, 50-63), in the trogg area, not between ranch and quarry.
# Skipped: 96393 Old Ironforge Incursion (Hall of Thanes dungeon), 95217 (12 Copper Bars),
# 912 (no giver data), 314 Protecting the Herd (elite).
# Carry-out: 263 (Stonesplinter Shamans and Bonesnappers, segment 5), 1338 Stormpike's Order
# (Stormwind, segment 4), 2039 Find Bingles (segment 5).

# --- Kharanos ---
A 94449 @ Dun Morogh, 47.4, 52.0 | Ingrid Dunwald, the shaman trainer in Kharanos (needs level 10): Call of Fire
TRAIN @ Dun Morogh, 47.4, 52.0 | Ingrid Dunwald: learn your level 10 spells (Flame Shock, Strength of Earth Totem, Flametongue Weapon). Sell and repair in Kharanos: the next vendors are at the quarry
A 96408 @ Dun Morogh, 50.4, 49.1 | Beldin Steelgrill, at Steelgrill's Depot just north-east of Kharanos

# --- Amberstill Ranch and Earthseer Farsen ---
A 95212 @ Dun Morogh, 63.1, 49.7 | Follow the road east to Amberstill Ranch: Rudra Amberstill. The pelts come from the leopards east of the quarry, together with the trogg quests
T 96408 @ Dun Morogh, 64.8, 58.4 | Earthseer Farsen's campsite is on the hillside south of the ranch, overlooking the Gol'Bolar Quarry from the west
A 96392 @ Dun Morogh, 64.9, 58.4
C 96392 @ Dun Morogh, 64.8, 58.4 | Talk to Farsen again and ask for his far sight; watch the vision until the objective ticks
T 96392 @ Dun Morogh, 64.9, 58.4
A 96390 @ Dun Morogh, 64.9, 58.4 | Farsen: 10 Dark Iron Spies at Ironband's Compound, east of the quarry

# --- Gol'Bolar Quarry ---
A 432 | Foreman Stonebrow, at the quarry camp
A 433 | Senator Mehr Stonehallow, next to him
A 95214 @ Dun Morogh, 69.1, 54.9 | Quarrymaster Thesten, on the north side of the camp. If he offers nothing, kill troggs until one drops an Empty Powder Keg, right-click it and bring it to him first (a small extra quest)
C 432 @ Dun Morogh, 70.3, 55.9 | Rockjaw Skullthumpers (8-9) fill the quarry pit right beside the camp: kill 6. Every trogg here can drop Stolen Blasting Powder
C 433,95214,95212 @ Dun Morogh, 73.6, 55.4 | Work east out of the quarry: kill 10 Rockjaw Bonesnappers (9-10) and keep killing troggs until you have 16 Stolen Blasting Powder. The big snow leopards on the slopes east and south-east of the quarry (70-78, 50-63) drop the 6 Pristine Leopard Pelts. Troggs stand close together: pull with Lightning Bolt, Stoneclaw Totem when two come
C 96390 @ Dun Morogh, 77.5, 60.8 | Ironband's Compound, the walled yard south-east of the quarry: kill 10 Dark Iron Spies (9-10). They are stealthed around the buildings, so walk slowly and let them come to you. Lightning Shield up, Healing Wave between fights
A 96391 @ Dun Morogh, 77.5, 60.8 | One of the spies drops a Dark Iron Map: right-click it in your bags to start this quest. No map after 10 spies? Kill a few more
T 432 | Foreman Stonebrow, back at the quarry camp
T 433 | Senator Mehr Stonehallow
T 95214 @ Dun Morogh, 69.1, 54.9 | Quarrymaster Thesten. Sell and repair at the camp
T 96390 @ Dun Morogh, 64.9, 58.4 | Earthseer Farsen, on the hillside west of the quarry
T 96391 @ Dun Morogh, 64.9, 58.4 | Farsen. Do NOT take his next quest (Old Ironforge Incursion): it is a dungeon
T 95212 @ Dun Morogh, 63.0, 49.8 | Rudra Amberstill, at Amberstill Ranch north of Farsen's camp

# --- North Gate Outpost ---
A 419 | Follow the road east and take the left (northern) branch to North Gate Outpost: Pilot Hammerfoot
T 419 | A Dwarven Corpse lies in the snow west of the outpost, on the slope north of the road
A 417 | From the corpse
C 417 @ Dun Morogh, 78.3, 37.8 | Mangeclaw (level 11 bear) prowls right next to the corpse. Fight him at full health: Stoneskin Totem down, Flame Shock, then melee. Loot the Mangy Claw
T 417 | Pilot Hammerfoot, back at North Gate Outpost

# --- South Gate Outpost and Bruegs ---
T 413 | Back to the fork and east to South Gate Outpost: Mountaineer Barleybrew
A 414 | Keep it: Mountaineer Kadrell is in Thelsamar
T 94449 @ Dun Morogh, 87.6, 43.7 | Bruegs Kindleborn is in a cave on the mountainside above South Gate Outpost, to the north: look for the path up from the outpost
A 94465 @ Dun Morogh, 87.6, 43.7 | He gives you the Torch of the Dormant Flame

# --- Loch Modan: Valley of Kings ---
A 224 | Go through the South Gate Pass tunnels into Loch Modan. Mountaineer Cobbleflint is at the guard tower in the Valley of Kings, just past the last tunnel
A 267 | Captain Rugelfuss, inside the tower
T 94465 @ Loch Modan, 32.1, 66.1 | Braldir Ashmantle guards the Shrine of the Dormant Flame, on a peak in the crags east of the Valley of Kings. A hidden path leads up to him from the trogg hills: follow the arrow and look for the trail up the slope
A 94466 @ Loch Modan, 32.1, 66.1 | He needs 1 Reagent Pouch (Stonesplinter Seers, here in the south) and 1 Fire Tar (Tunnel Rat Geomancers, in the mine up north, later)
C 224 @ Loch Modan, 30.8, 68.2 | Stonesplinter Valley, the trogg hills around and south of the shrine: kill 10 Stonesplinter Troggs and 10 Stonesplinter Scouts (11-12). Every trogg can drop a Trogg Stone Tooth
C 94466:2 @ Loch Modan, 31.0, 84.0 | Stonesplinter Seers (13-14) stand in the southern end of the valley (27-36, 81-90): kill them until one drops the Reagent Pouch. They are 2-3 levels above you: pull one alone, Earth Shock its Lightning Bolt, Stoneskin Totem, and back off to heal if a second joins
C 267 @ Loch Modan, 30.8, 70.0 | Finish 8 Trogg Stone Teeth on any troggs on the way back north-west to the tower
T 224 | Mountaineer Cobbleflint, at the southern guard tower
T 267 | Captain Rugelfuss
A 237 | Mountaineer Gravelgaw, a little south of the tower. You do this one at the end of the segment

# --- Thelsamar ---
T 414 | Follow the road north-east to Thelsamar: Mountaineer Kadrell patrols the main street
A 416,1339 | Kadrell gives both
A 418 | Vidra Hearthstove, in the inn (Stoutlager Inn)
S Thelsamar | Make the inn your home: talk to Innkeeper Hearthstove
A 6387 | Brock Stoneseeker, in the house at the east end of town (dwarves and gnomes only)
N Grenhild Darktalon in Thelsamar offers Snowbound (a jar of snow from the South Gate Pass to the north shore). Skip it: it does not fit this loop
T 6387 | Thorgrum Borrelson, the gryphon master on the south side of town
A 6391
F Thelsamar | Thorgrum Borrelson
FLY Ironforge

# --- Ironforge ---
T 6391 @ Ironforge, 51.5, 26.3 | Golnir Bouldertoe, at the Great Forge, north of where you land
A 6388 @ Ironforge, 51.5, 26.3
TRAIN @ Ironforge, 47.6, 13.5 | Eldrun Stormbreaker, at the north end of the city: learn your level 12 spells (Healing Wave rank 3, Purge, Ancestral Spirit). Sell, repair and buy water in the city
A 2039 @ Ironforge, 69.2, 50.6 | Gnoarn, in Tinker Town on the east side (needs level 12). Keep it: Bingles is on the east shore of the Loch, a later segment. Not 12 yet? Skip it for now: you are back in Ironforge at the start of the next segment
T 6388 @ Ironforge, 55.5, 47.7 | Gryth Thurden, the gryphon master
A 6392 @ Ironforge, 55.5, 47.7
FLY Thelsamar
T 6392 | Brock Stoneseeker, at the east end of Thelsamar

# --- North Loch Modan ---
C 418 @ Loch Modan, 31.5, 39.0 | On the way north kill Elder Black Bears (Bear Meat), Mountain Boars (Boar Intestines) and Forest Lurkers (Spider Ichor) beside the road: 3 of each item
T 1339 | Mountaineer Stormpike, at the top of the northern guard tower (Algaz Station), in the north-west corner of the zone
A 307,1338 | Stormpike gives both. Keep Stormpike's Order: it goes to Stormwind next segment
C 307,416,94466:1 @ Loch Modan, 35.5, 24.3 | Silver Stream Mine, the kobold cave east of the tower. Open 4 Miners' League Crates inside for the Miners' Gear, cut 12 Tunnel Rat Ears from any kobold (they also stand outside the mine), and kill Tunnel Rat Geomancers (12-13, deep in the mine) until one drops the Fire Tar. Geomancers cast fire: Earth Shock them. Kobolds flee at low health: Earthbind Totem
T 307 | Back west to Mountaineer Stormpike
C 418 @ Loch Modan, 33.0, 31.5 | Finish the sausage meats on the walk back south to Thelsamar
T 416 | Mountaineer Kadrell, in Thelsamar
T 418 | Vidra Hearthstove, in the inn. Sell and repair before you leave

# --- The Shrine of the Dormant Flame ---
T 94466 @ Loch Modan, 32.1, 66.1 | South again, up the hidden path to Braldir Ashmantle
A 94467 @ Loch Modan, 32.1, 66.1 | He gives you a Fire Sapta
C 94467 @ Loch Modan, 31.9, 64.5 | Drink the Fire Sapta at the shrine, then climb to the peak. The Minor Manifestation of Fire does not attack until you do: start at full health and mana, Stoneskin Totem down, Earth Shock on cooldown, and kill it fast (it gets stronger the longer you wait). Loot the Glowing Ember
T 94467 @ Loch Modan, 31.9, 64.5 | Click the Brazier of the Dormant Flame on the peak
A 94468 @ Loch Modan, 31.9, 64.5 | The brazier gives you the Torch of the Eternal Flame
C 237 @ Loch Modan, 33.0, 76.0 | Kill 10 Stonesplinter Skullthumpers and 10 Stonesplinter Seers (13-14) in the hills south of the shrine. One at a time: Earth Shock the Seers' casts, Stoneclaw Totem if you get an add, Healing Wave between pulls
T 237 | Mountaineer Gravelgaw, a little south of the southern guard tower
A 263 | Mountaineer Wallbang, at the tower. Keep it: the Shamans and Bonesnappers are level 15-16, for your next Loch Modan visit

# --- Back to Bruegs ---
T 94468 @ Dun Morogh, 87.6, 43.7 | Walk back west through the South Gate Pass tunnels and up to Bruegs Kindleborn above South Gate Outpost. You get the Fire Totem (keep it in your bags) and learn Searing Totem
H Thelsamar | The next segment starts with the gryphon from Thelsamar to Ironforge
